nb.cells=[md('# Phase 13 — KUB Predicted ROI Proposal / Localizer Development\n\nGT-free proposal generation from frozen UNet++ global probability maps. GT is used only after proposal generation for localization evaluation. No segmentation/refiner training, Oracle proposal generation, TEST access, or external-data access.'),code("from pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom IPython.display import display,Image\nROOT=Path.cwd().resolve();ROOT=ROOT.parent if ROOT.name=='notebooks' else ROOT\nT=ROOT/'reports/tables';F=ROOT/'reports/figures/phase13_predicted_roi';Q=ROOT/'reports/qualitative/phase13_predicted_roi'\nsearch=pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_search.csv');selected=pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_selected_config.csv');components=pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_per_component.csv');images=pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_per_image.csv')\nassert len(search)==324 and len(components)==156 and len(images)==106\nprint('Governance PASS: VAL FULL_FIELD only; frozen UNet++; TEST NOT ACCESSED; no training')"),md('## Phase-12 motivation and Oracle/deployable distinction\n\nOracle25 used GT localization and demonstrated resolution headroom. Phase 13 does not use GT to generate boxes: it thresholds frozen coarse probabilities, labels predicted components, scores by maximum component probability, applies predicted-box NMS and Top-K, and expands predicted boxes. Oracle availability is 100% by definition and is not deployment performance.'),md('## Predeclared search grid and frozen selection rule'),code("print('Thresholds:',sorted(search.proposal_threshold.unique()))\nprint('Margins:',sorted(search.margin.unique()))\nprint('Top-K:',sorted(search.top_k.unique()))\nprint('NMS:',sorted(search.nms_iou.unique()))\ndisplay(selected)"),md('## Recall and proposal efficiency trade-offs'),code("display(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_proposal_recall_vs_threshold.png'),width=800))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_tiny_recall_vs_threshold.png'),width=800))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_recall_vs_roi_area_tradeoff.png'),width=800))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_recall_vs_proposal_count.png'),width=800))"),md('## Localization by original-space size and global misses'),code("display(pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_size_summary.csv'))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_size_stratum_localization.png'),width=800))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_global_miss_recovery_localization.png'),width=800))"),md('## Empty global predictions and zero-proposal cases'),code("display(pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_global_empty_case_analysis.csv'))\ndisplay(pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_zero_proposal_analysis.csv'))"),md('## Multi-component localization'),code("display(pd.read_csv(T/'phase13_predicted_roi_multicomponent.csv'))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_multicomponent_localization.png'),width=800))"),md('## Search heatmap, coverage distribution, burden, and unmatched proposals'),code("display(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_proposal_parameter_heatmap.png'),width=750))\ndisplay(Image(filename=str(F/'phase13_component_coverage_distribution.png'),width=800))\ndisplay(images[['proposal_count','total_roi_area_fraction','unmatched_proposals','zero_proposal']].describe())"),md('## Deterministic qualitative panel\n\nRed boxes are **PREDICTED** from coarse probability only. Green contours are **GT EVALUATION ONLY** and were not used to generate proposals.'),code("display(Image(filename=str(Q/'phase13_predicted_roi_localization_panel.png'),width=1300))"),md('## Phase-14 gate and limitations\n\n**Gate: WEAK.** Overall coverage recall is moderate with very low ROI-area burden, but the selected configuration localizes none of the 16 globally missed TINY components and none of the seven global-empty cases. A regional refiner trained only on these proposals would not access the key Oracle TINY headroom. A separately authorized stronger learned-localizer study should be considered before regional-refiner training. This is single-VAL descriptive development; no final segmentation superiority is claimed. **Phase 14 not executed. TEST NOT ACCESSED. STOP.**')]
